{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "SessionStart", "additionalContext": "agent-bus: this session has no inbox socket. To be woken, run `pingbus wait` with run_in_background.\nagent-bus: in team team-a you are the coordinator. Workers report to you and copy you on what they tell humans; when a human asks you to get something done, work out how and dispatch it to the workers, then track it.\nagent-bus: in team team-a, questions only a human can answer go to the questions room with `pingbus ask-human`; every human message there is delivered to you. Run `pingbus questions` now and pass on any answer not yet passed on.\nagent-bus: in team team-a, report what the humans should know with `pingbus report`."}}
